msgctxt "quest/031/BanNam603_03125:TEXT_BANNAM603_03125_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "Seigetsu the Enlightened has learned of a celebration even he would not try.<br><br>※Please note that the difficulty of this quest has been synced to your current level. Furthermore, you may not proceed with a class or job that is different from when you accepted this quest."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 明けの玉座の気弱なナマズオと話す
#. de: Am Morgenthron mit dem ängstlichen Namazuo sprechen
#. fr: Parler au Namazu poltron, au Trône de l'Aube
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/031/BanNam603_03125:TEXT_BANNAM603_03125_SEQ_01:1"
msgid "Speak with the nervous Namazu."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 明けの玉座の気弱なナマズオに依頼された品を納品
#. de: Dem ängstlichen Namazuo am Morgenthron die gewünschte Ware bringen
#. fr: Livrer ce qui vous a été demandé au Namazu poltron
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/031/BanNam603_03125:TEXT_BANNAM603_03125_SEQ_02:1"
msgid "Deliver the requested supplies to the nervous Namazu."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 明けの玉座周辺で気弱なナマズオを探す
#. de: Den ängstlichen Namazuo beim Morgenthron suchen und retten
#. fr: Chercher le Namazu poltron en contrebas du Trône de l'Aube
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/031/BanNam603_03125:TEXT_BANNAM603_03125_SEQ_03:1"
msgid "Search for signs of the nervous Namazu around the Dawn Throne."
msgstr ""

